      "content": "i get that but my doctor just told me to eat more veggies in general like, without being too specific about types. i dont want to keep going back for every little thing. if i just stick to doing it every morning it should be fine right? i feel like the juice is healthy enough that it shouldn't be a huge deal since it's just natural stuff.",
