      "content": "i mean i hear you, but i'm already taking my meds exactly how they're supposed to be. i'm not trying to be reckless, i just think that since it's just juice and it's part of a healthy lifestyle, it's better for my heart in the long run. if i just blend it in and don't make a massive change all at once, won't my body just adjust to it? can't i just start with a small amount of spinach in my smoothie and see how i feel?",
